isions."] "\n\n" [:p {} "In the semi-finals, both Rashidov and Punia went out, the Russian losing to home country favorite " [:a {:href "/athletes/144748"} "Takuto Otoguro"] ", the 2018 World Champion. Punia lost to Azerbaijani " [:a {:href "/athletes/132626"} "Hacı Əliyev"] ", who was a three-time World Champion at 61 kg, but from back in 2014-17. Əliyev had also won bronze at the 2016 Rio Olympics at 57 kg."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The final was a mismatch as Otoguro dominated Əliyev, who only held on, 9-0, to avoid a technical superiority decision. Rashidov and Punia had some measure of redemption when they won their repêchage finals to earn bronze medals."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Classification Points", :class "footnote"} "CP"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Victories by Fall", :class "footnote"} "VF"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Victories by Technical Superiority", :class "footnote"} "ST"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Technical Points", :class "footnote"} "TP"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Technical Points Received", :class "footnote"} "TPR"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/144748"} "Takuto Otoguro"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/JPN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/JPN.png"}] "JPN"]] [:td {} "12"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "18"] [:td {} "10"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/132626"} "Hacı Əliyev"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/AZE"} [:img {: